# Hands-on Practice

## Find the Largest Log Files/Directories

```bash
du -sh /var/log/* 2>/dev/null | sort -h | tail -5
```

### Observation

Displays the largest entries under `/var/log`, with the five largest shown at the end.

---

## Check Hostname

```bash
cat /etc/hostname
```

### Observation

Displays the hostname configured for the Linux machine.

---

## Check Home Directory

```bash
ls -la ~
```

### Observation

Lists all files, including hidden files, in the current user's home directory.

